        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e0c453871afee22c2856369",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹将从两人身上学到的东西融入自身。\n慢慢地，花费了足够的时间……。",
